            DFL.GCI.angularDerivative n (DFL.GCI.positiveTestState n) θ +
          DFL.GCI.angularPotential n θ * (DFL.GCI.positiveTestState n).g θ * (DFL.GCI.positiveTestState n).g θ))
    MeasureTheory.volume 0 Real.pi
